  "details": "Please I'm literally begging you guys to add the stream camera option but for quest! I wanna make similar videos that PC users can  me and and a ton of other people would benefit from this you can add a record button in it and it can record and save videos like how the normal picture could \n\nI am fully aware some ppl requested this already but idk if they ever put details into why\n\nBut content creators who only have quest would completely benefit to this ! Alot of us either can't connect our quest to pc/laptop bc it just refuses or some may not even have a PC \n\nIt would make a insane difference if such feature was added",
